  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pizza capricciosa is the Italian pizzeria's most generous pizza: artichoke hearts, cooked ham, mushrooms, and black olives on a tomato and mozzarella base. Each topping is placed in a separate section rather than mixed together, so each bite is different. It uses the same dough as any Neapolitan-style pizza: the distinction is the toppings."
          }
        ]
      },
